Description: TI EdgeAI RTOS firmware for 4 GiB J722S systems
 RTOS firmware images rebuilt from pinned PSDK 11.02 sources for the R5F MCU
 and both C7x/MMA DSP cores on the 4 GiB AM67A/J722S BeagleY-AI. The shared
 DMA heap, firmware MMU/RAT settings, and Linux reserved-memory layout use one
 matched BeagleY-specific ABI.
 .
 Firmware is installed below /usr/lib/firmware/vision_apps_eaik, with links
 under the canonical J722S remoteproc names. The EVM Ethernet-firmware payload
 is deliberately excluded because Ethernet is owned by Linux on BeagleY-AI.
